+# SeeCut application asset
+
+`seecut-logo.png` is copied byte-for-byte from the SeeCut host repository at
+`src/crates/concat/ui/assets/seecut-logo.png`, commit `247334c2f37cde265b2424923fd3386e23dcc0f3`.
+It is used only to identify this SeeCut integration. It is not a PhotoCraft or ArtCraft mark.
+The upstream MIT OR Apache-2.0 code license does not grant rights to this SeeCut brand asset.
+The existing SeeCut asset rights remain applicable; this file grants no additional rights.
+
+The in-editor letter S follows the existing SeeCut `ui/brand-mark.slint` component.
